---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Cookies — Mapache Softworks GmbH"
	description="Cookies policy for Mapache Softworks GmbH and its websites and apps."
>
	<section class="hero">
		<div class="container legal">
			<p class="eyebrow">Cookies and similar technologies</p>
			<h1>Cookies Policy</h1>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section>
		<div class="container legal panel reveal">
			<p class="lede">Last updated: July 13, 2026</p>

			<p>Mapache Softworks GmbH ("us", "we", or "our") uses cookies on our websites and apps, including but not limited to:</p>
			<ul class="list">
				<li><a href="https://mapache-soft.com">https://mapache-soft.com</a> (the "Company Website")</li>
				<li><a href="https://archiverapp.com">https://archiverapp.com</a> (the "Archiver App")</li>
				<li><a href="https://renamer.com">https://renamer.com</a> (the "Renamer App")</li>
			</ul>

			<p>By using any of our websites or apps, you consent to the use of cookies in accordance with this policy. Our Cookies Policy explains what cookies are, how we use cookies, your choices regarding cookies, and further information about cookies.</p>

			<h2>What are cookies</h2>
			<p>Cookies are small pieces of text sent to your web browser by a website you visit. A cookie file is stored in your web browser and allows the website or a third-party to recognize you and make your next visit easier and the website more useful to you.</p>
			<p>Cookies can be "persistent" or "session" cookies. Persistent cookies remain on your personal computer or mobile device when you go offline, while session cookies are deleted as soon as you close your web browser.</p>

			<h2>How Mapache Softworks GmbH uses cookies</h2>
			<p>When you use and access our websites and apps, we may place strictly essential cookies in your web browser. We use strictly essential cookies for the following purposes:</p>
			<ul class="list">
				<li>To maintain the security and availability of our websites and apps</li>
				<li>To enable certain features that are necessary for the operation of our services</li>
			</ul>
			<p>These cookies are necessary for the operation of our websites and apps and cannot be disabled. They do not store any personally identifiable information.</p>

			<h2>What are your choices regarding cookies</h2>
			<p>Since we only use strictly essential cookies, you cannot opt out of these cookies if you wish to use our websites and apps. However, you can manage cookies through your browser settings. Most browsers provide options to manage cookies, including deleting existing cookies and blocking new ones. For detailed instructions, please refer to the help section of your specific web browser.</p>
			<p>You can also find general information about managing cookies on websites like:</p>
			<ul class="list">
				<li><a href="http://www.allaboutcookies.org/">AllAboutCookies</a></li>
				<li><a href="http://www.networkadvertising.org/">Network Advertising Initiative</a></li>
			</ul>
			<p>Please note that if you delete cookies or refuse to accept them, you might not be able to use all of the features we offer, you may not be able to store your preferences, and some of our pages might not display properly.</p>

			<h2>Where can you find more information about cookies</h2>
			<p>You can learn more about cookies at the following third-party websites:</p>
			<ul class="list">
				<li>AllAboutCookies: <a href="http://www.allaboutcookies.org/">http://www.allaboutcookies.org/</a></li>
				<li>Network Advertising Initiative: <a href="http://www.networkadvertising.org/">http://www.networkadvertising.org/</a></li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
